inaenaleyh burada şerayi'ı salifenin pek güzel bir inkişaf ile takriri vardır. Bundan sapanların üzerinden nazarı İlâhî çekilir ve tekrar bu yola sülûk edenlere de yine nazarı İlâhî avdet eder. Zira « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"357\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 356.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 20.2 32.2 32.2 39.0 39.0 45.7 52.4 52.4 68.2 75.0 90.7 97.4 105.7 105.7 113.2 113.2 113.2 120.0 126.7 126.7 142.4 153.7 153.7 153.7 160.4 181.4 181.4 188.2 188.2 196.4 203.2 203.2 219.0 225.7 241.4 241.4 249.0 249.0 249.0 255.7 262.4 262.4 278.2 299.2 306.0 306.0 306.0 312.7 320.2 336.0 336.0 346.4 346.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"20.2 45.7 75.0 120.0 160.4 196.4 225.7 255.7 282.7 299.2 336.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dir. İşbu « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"230\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 229.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 24.0 24.0 30.7 30.7 37.6 53.3 53.3 63.7 63.7 79.6 90.0 96.7 96.7 105.7 105.7 113.3 129.0 139.6 146.3 166.6 166.6 175.6 175.6 187.6 194.3 194.3 203.3 203.3 211.6 218.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 79.6 105.7 129.0 139.6 146.3 187.6 211.6 218.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » nassı celîli şerayii mütekaddimeden ba'zı ahkâmın takririne delâlet ettiği cihetle İlmi usuld